WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.517
Meet Speak My Talk. It is a free phone app that helps people whose speech is hard to understand be understood.

2
00:00:06.517 --> 00:00:13.529
Conditions like ALS, cerebral palsy, stroke and Parkinson's can cause dysarthria. Speech becomes hard for

3
00:00:13.529 --> 00:00:17.603
other people, and for normal voice assistants, to understand.

4
00:00:17.603 --> 00:00:24.198
In the United States, about 1 in 14 children has had a voice, speech or language disorder in the past year, and

5
00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:27.110
about 18 million adults have had a voice problem.

6
00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:35.398
Here is how it works. First, train. You, or someone helping you, record a few examples of each word and type

7
00:00:35.398 --> 00:00:36.165
its label.

8
00:00:36.165 --> 00:00:42.107
Then, use. Say the word, and the app shows it in big text and speaks it clearly.

9
00:00:42.107 --> 00:00:48.824
It works in any language. You can type your words in any language or script, such as Hindi or Arabic.

10
00:00:48.824 --> 00:00:52.990
In sentence mode, say a few trained words with short pauses between them.

11
00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:58.795
If it gets a word wrong, just tap the right one. It gets better as you add more examples.

12
00:00:58.795 --> 00:01:05.967
It is private and works offline. Your recordings stay on your phone. No internet, and no account.

13
00:01:05.967 --> 00:01:11.520
It is easy to use, with big buttons, clear instructions, and help that can be read aloud.

14
00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:18.364
Speak My Talk is free, for Android and iPhone, coming soon. It is currently a prototype in testing.

15
00:01:18.364 --> 00:01:25.229
Speak My Talk. Your words, understood. A project by Dr. Chindanoor Rajesh.

16
00:01:25.229 --> 00:01:31.428
Part of Ability Enhancer Apps. Visit abilityenhancerapps.com, or reach us at

17
00:01:31.428 --> 00:01:33.875
abilityenhancerapps@gmail.com.
